    <!-- Planning notes (from the Combined Mathematics tab of the Grade 12 Book Structure Mapping sheet)
         Content summary: Measures of central tendency by calculation. Core uses an assumed mean; Essential does not require it.
         Suggested activity: Learners collect the heights or masses of 30 classmates and calculate the mean using an assumed mean, then the median and quartiles. -->

    <!-- Section notes (2026-11)
         SLOs: Core (a); Essential (a), (c) ungrouped. Lessons 1.1 to 1.3 as subsections.
         Activity: as planning notes (heights; mean, then median and quartiles) | changed: groups of 10 to 12, not 30
